UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I am not sure we could make anything. It is hard to know. Had I overcalled 2@S, I suspect we will get too high, probably to 2N which actually has plays because of the favorable spades. |
PG| ***** 34 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|In 2N, if declarer cashes the @SA and leads a low spade we  will take 4 spades and 2 diamonds for sure. A may be able to scramble for 2 more tricks in hearts and clubs, although maybe not.|
PG| ***** 35 ***** |


