mb|P|mb|P|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|In 1st or 2nd seat, I would open my hand 1@H. But in 3rd seat, with a nice hand and a nice 7+ card major suit, there is a good case for opening 4, as that is somewhat likely to be where you want to play and also makes it hard on the opponents.|
