UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|We may still end up in 4@H if I open 1@H. In that case, EW will get to show their spade suit and compete. Not vulnerable, 4@S may be a good sacrifice losing 1 heart, 2 diamonds and one club for down 1. By bidding 4@H I prevented EW from easily finding 4@S.|
